      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "While propoxyphene may have filled a niche when it was first marketed in 1957, newer, safer agents are now available. Multiple experts list the drug as one to avoid in the elderly patient. Evidence-based practice requires its use be minimized, especially in individuals over the age of 65."},
